      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/eng@/~cl_18__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/eng@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1) as renumbered, by substituting for the word “Any” the words “Subject to subsection (2), any”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/eng@/~cl_18__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/eng@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) as renumbered the following subsection: “(2) The Minister may, on the recommendation of the Corporation, by order published in the Gazette— (a) provide for the partial or total reduction, waiver, refund or rebate of the amount of any premium or premium surcharge to such deposit-taking member; and (b) specify any condition in respect of paragraph (a).”. Amendment of section 63"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/eng@/~cl_19",
