        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of “Registrar of Companies” the following definition: ‘ “Registrar of Companies” means the Registrar designated under subsection 20a(1) of the Companies Commision of Malaysia Act 2001 [Act 614];’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/eng@/~cl_3__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
